---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
const built = new Date().toISOString();
---
<BlockLayout title="Cast Color — pick four colors, hear a chord progression" description="Each of twelve colors is a chord. Pick four colors into the progression slots, hit play. The page cycles your colors as a 4-chord vamp. Save and share via URL hash.">
  <main class="cco" id="cco" data-built={built}>
    <header class="cco__hero">
      <p class="cco__kicker">CAST · COLOR · twelve colors · four chords · vamp</p>
      <h1 class="cco__title">Color.</h1>
      <p class="cco__sub">Each of twelve colors below is a chord — major, minor, suspended, seventh. Click four into the slots in any order. Hit play. The page cycles your colors as a 4-chord vamp. Save the progression via URL hash.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="cco__progression" id="cco-progression"></section>

    <section class="cco__palette" id="cco-palette"></section>

    <section class="cco__transport">
      <button class="cco__play" id="cco-play" type="button">
        <span class="cco__play-icon" id="cco-play-icon">▶</span>
        <span class="cco__play-label" id="cco-play-label">PLAY VAMP</span>
      </button>
      <button class="cco__clear" id="cco-clear" type="button">CLEAR</button>
      <button class="cco__shuffle" id="cco-shuffle" type="button">RANDOMIZE</button>
      <button class="cco__share" id="cco-share" type="button">SHARE</button>
      <div class="cco__tempo">
        <span class="cco__tempo-label">TEMPO · <span id="cco-tempo-val">76</span> BPM (2 beats per chord)</span>
        <input type="range" class="cco__tempo-range" id="cco-tempo" min="50" max="120" value="76"/>
      </div>
      <span class="cco__share-status" id="cco-share-status"></span>
    </section>

    <section class="cco__about">
      <h2 class="cco__about-h">The mapping</h2>
      <p>Twelve colors, twelve chords. The mapping is hand-picked — warm colors lean major, cool lean minor, and a few sits-in-the-middle types get sus and 7th chords. Roots are spread across all 12 pitch classes so any four colors give a complete-feeling progression.</p>
      <p>Voicing is a 4-note pad in the chord's root register: root + third + fifth + (seventh or octave depending on quality), played with a 3-oscillator soft sine voice with 80ms attack and 1.2s decay. Each chord holds for 2 beats at the chosen tempo. Default 76 BPM gives a slow ballad feel — drag tempo up to 120 for a busier vamp.</p>
      <p>Share button serializes the four color indices and tempo into a URL hash you can paste anywhere. Anyone who opens the link hears the same progression.</p>
      <p>Pair with <a href="/cast-wheel">/cast-wheel</a> for the harmonic geography, <a href="/cast-letter">/cast-letter</a> for text-as-melody, <a href="/cast-shape">/cast-shape</a> for visual-as-melody. This page rounds out the input-modality trio: text, shape, color.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --cco-ink: #0a0813;
      --cco-walnut: #4a2a1a;
      --cco-flame: #f6c15e;
      --cco-flame-deep: #d68f2c;
      --cco-cream: #f4e7c8;
      --cco-cream-dim: #c8b48a;
      --cco-cream-dimmer: #8b7a5a;
      --cco-mint: #9bd7b8;
    }

    body:has(.cco) {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #1c0c24 0%, var(--cco-ink) 60%);
      color: var(--cco-cream);
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .cco { max-width: 1020px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }

    .cco__hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .cco__kicker {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--cco-flame-deep);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .cco__title {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: clamp(56px, 12vw, 140px);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 0.9;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--cco-flame);
      text-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }
    .cco__sub {
      max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--cco-cream-dim);
    }

    /* PROGRESSION SLOTS */
    .cco__progression {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .cco__progression { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
    .cco__slot {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 2px dashed rgba(246,193,94,0.32);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 100ms ease, border-color 100ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cco__slot--filled {
      border-style: solid;
      border-color: transparent;
    }
    .cco__slot--playing {
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(246,193,94,0.55);
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }
    .cco__slot-fill {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      transition: opacity 200ms ease;
    }
    .cco__slot-num {
      position: absolute;
      top: 10px;
      left: 12px;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
      text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cco__slot--filled .cco__slot-num { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
    .cco__slot-chord {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 12px;
      left: 12px;
      right: 12px;
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cco__slot-empty {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: rgba(244,231,200,0.5);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cco__slot--filled .cco__slot-empty { display: none; }

    /* PALETTE */
    .cco__palette {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .cco__palette { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
    .cco__swatch {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 0;
      box-shadow: inset 0 -4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.16), 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      transition: transform 100ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
    }
    .cco__swatch:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .cco__swatch--active { animation: ccoPlay 1.2s ease-out; }
    @keyframes ccoPlay {
      0%   { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.7), 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
      40%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.0), 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
      100% { box-shadow: inset 0 -4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.16), 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
    }
    .cco__swatch-name {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 8px;
      left: 8px;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cco__swatch-chord {
      position: absolute;
      top: 8px;
      right: 10px;
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* TRANSPORT */
    .cco__transport {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .cco__play {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 0;
      background: var(--cco-flame);
      color: var(--cco-walnut);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(246,193,94,0.32);
    }
    .cco__play:hover { background: var(--cco-flame-deep); }
    .cco__clear, .cco__shuffle, .cco__share {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,193,94,0.32);
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--cco-cream);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 100ms ease;
    }
    .cco__clear:hover, .cco__shuffle:hover, .cco__share:hover { background: rgba(246,193,94,0.12); }
    .cco__tempo {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 240px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .cco__tempo-label {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--cco-cream-dimmer);
    }
    .cco__tempo-range { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--cco-flame); }
    .cco__share-status {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--cco-mint);
    }

    /* ABOUT */
    .cco__about {
      max-width: 740px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(246,193,94,0.14);
    }
    .cco__about-h {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--cco-cream);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .cco__about p {
      font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--cco-cream-dim);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .cco__about a { color: var(--cco-flame); text-decoration: none; }
    .cco__about a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>

  <script>
    import { createAudioScheduler } from '../lib/audio-scheduler';

    // Color → chord mapping.
    // Each color has a hex, display name, chord label, and array of MIDI offsets from root.
    // Roots span 12 pitch classes spread across the palette.
    type Quality = { intervals: number[]; label: string };
    const MAJ: Quality   = { intervals: [0, 4, 7],     label: '' };
    const MIN: Quality   = { intervals: [0, 3, 7],     label: 'm' };
    const SUS4: Quality  = { intervals: [0, 5, 7],     label: 'sus4' };
    const SUS2: Quality  = { intervals: [0, 2, 7],     label: 'sus2' };
    const M7: Quality    = { intervals: [0, 4, 7, 11], label: 'maj7' };
    const m7: Quality    = { intervals: [0, 3, 7, 10], label: 'm7' };
    const D7: Quality    = { intervals: [0, 4, 7, 10], label: '7' };

    type Color = { hex: string; name: string; rootMidi: number; quality: Quality; rootName: string };
    const PALETTE: Color[] = [
      { hex: '#e6788c', name: 'rose',   rootMidi: 62, quality: MIN,  rootName: 'D'  },  // Dm
      { hex: '#f6c15e', name: 'flame',  rootMidi: 60, quality: MAJ,  rootName: 'C'  },  // C
      { hex: '#f08a3c', name: 'amber',  rootMidi: 65, quality: D7,   rootName: 'F'  },  // F7
      { hex: '#f4e7c8', name: 'cream',  rootMidi: 67, quality: M7,   rootName: 'G'  },  // Gmaj7
      { hex: '#9bd7b8', name: 'mint',   rootMidi: 64, quality: m7,   rootName: 'E'  },  // Em7
      { hex: '#4a8fb3', name: 'teal',   rootMidi: 69, quality: SUS4, rootName: 'A'  },  // Asus4
      { hex: '#9ed6f0', name: 'sky',    rootMidi: 71, quality: SUS2, rootName: 'B'  },  // Bsus2
      { hex: '#3a6db8', name: 'blue',   rootMidi: 57, quality: MIN,  rootName: 'A'  },  // Am
      { hex: '#b39ddb', name: 'mauve',  rootMidi: 66, quality: m7,   rootName: 'F♯' },  // F#m7
      { hex: '#7a3fa6', name: 'violet', rootMidi: 70, quality: MIN,  rootName: 'A♯' },  // A#m
      { hex: '#c08b3a', name: 'walnut', rootMidi: 63, quality: MAJ,  rootName: 'D♯' },  // D#
      { hex: '#5a3422', name: 'umber',  rootMidi: 68, quality: M7,   rootName: 'G♯' },  // G#maj7
    ];

    function chordLabel(c: Color): string {
      return `${c.rootName}${c.quality.label}`;
    }

    // ---- state ----
    let slots: (number | null)[] = [null, null, null, null];
    let tempo = 76;
    let playing = false;
    let beatsPerChord = 2;
    let activeSlot = -1;

    let ctx: AudioContext | null = null;
    let scheduler: ReturnType<typeof createAudioScheduler> | null = null;
    let masterGain: GainNode | null = null;
    let scheduleTimer: number | null = null;
    let startCtxTime = 0;

    function ensureCtx() {
      if (ctx) return;
      ctx = new (window.AudioContext || (window as any).webkitAudioContext)();
      scheduler = createAudioScheduler(ctx);
      masterGain = ctx.createGain();
      masterGain.gain.value = 0.45;
      masterGain.connect(ctx.destination);
    }
    function midiToHz(m: number) { return 440 * Math.pow(2, (m - 69) / 12); }
    function beatSec() { return 60 / tempo; }

    function playChord(c: Color, atCtxTime: number, durSec: number) {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain) return;
      const tail = Math.max(durSec, 0.3);
      for (const offset of c.quality.intervals) {
        const hz = midiToHz(c.rootMidi + offset);
        const stacks = [
          { freq: hz, gain: 0.16 },
          { freq: hz, gain: 0.10, detune: 4 },
          { freq: hz * 2, gain: 0.03 },
        ];
        for (const v of stacks) {
          const osc = ctx.createOscillator();
          const g = ctx.createGain();
          osc.type = 'sine';
          osc.frequency.value = v.freq;
          if ((v as any).detune) osc.detune.value = (v as any).detune;
          g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, atCtxTime);
          g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(v.gain, atCtxTime + 0.08);
          g.gain.setValueAtTime(v.gain, atCtxTime + tail - 0.2);
          g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, atCtxTime + tail + 0.2);
          osc.connect(g).connect(masterGain);
          scheduler.trackSource(osc);
          osc.start(atCtxTime);
          osc.stop(atCtxTime + tail + 0.25);
        }
      }
      // Add a soft sub for body
      const subHz = midiToHz(c.rootMidi - 12);
      const subOsc = ctx.createOscillator();
      const subG = ctx.createGain();
      subOsc.type = 'sine';
      subOsc.frequency.value = subHz;
      subG.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, atCtxTime);
      subG.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.12, atCtxTime + 0.06);
      subG.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, atCtxTime + tail + 0.4);
      subOsc.connect(subG).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(subOsc);
      subOsc.start(atCtxTime);
      subOsc.stop(atCtxTime + tail + 0.45);
    }

    function scheduleAhead() {
      if (!playing || !ctx) return;
      const horizon = ctx.currentTime + 0.6;
      const bs = beatSec();
      const chordSec = beatsPerChord * bs;
      // figure out which slot we're on based on elapsed time
      const elapsed = ctx.currentTime - startCtxTime;
      const chordIdx = Math.floor(elapsed / chordSec);
      const nextChordTime = startCtxTime + (chordIdx + 1) * chordSec;
      if (nextChordTime < horizon) {
        const slotIdx = (chordIdx + 1) % 4;
        const colorIdx = slots[slotIdx];
        if (colorIdx != null) {
          playChord(PALETTE[colorIdx], nextChordTime, chordSec);
        }
      }
      scheduleTimer = window.setTimeout(scheduleAhead, 70);
    }

    function startVamp() {
      ensureCtx();
      if (!ctx) return;
      // require at least one filled slot
      if (!slots.some(s => s != null)) return;
      if (ctx.state === 'suspended') ctx.resume();
      playing = true;
      startCtxTime = ctx.currentTime + 0.1;
      // Schedule the first chord immediately
      const firstColorIdx = slots[0];
      if (firstColorIdx != null) {
        playChord(PALETTE[firstColorIdx], startCtxTime, beatsPerChord * beatSec());
      }
      document.getElementById('cco-play-icon')!.textContent = '■';
      document.getElementById('cco-play-label')!.textContent = 'STOP';
      scheduleAhead();
      tickAnim();
    }

    function stopVamp() {
      playing = false;
      if (scheduleTimer != null) { clearTimeout(scheduleTimer); scheduleTimer = null; }
      if (scheduler) scheduler.stopAll();
      document.getElementById('cco-play-icon')!.textContent = '▶';
      document.getElementById('cco-play-label')!.textContent = 'PLAY VAMP';
      activeSlot = -1;
      renderSlots();
      renderPalette();
    }

    function tickAnim() {
      if (!playing || !ctx) return;
      const elapsed = ctx.currentTime - startCtxTime;
      const chordSec = beatsPerChord * beatSec();
      const newActive = Math.floor(elapsed / chordSec) % 4;
      if (newActive !== activeSlot) {
        activeSlot = newActive;
        renderSlots();
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tickAnim);
    }

    // ---- rendering ----
    function renderSlots() {
      const wrap = document.getElementById('cco-progression')!;
      wrap.innerHTML = slots.map((colorIdx, i) => {
        const filled = colorIdx != null;
        const isPlaying = playing && i === activeSlot;
        const color = filled ? PALETTE[colorIdx as number] : null;
        return `
        <button class="cco__slot${filled ? ' cco__slot--filled' : ''}${isPlaying ? ' cco__slot--playing' : ''}" data-slot="${i}">
          ${filled ? `<div class="cco__slot-fill" style="background:${color!.hex}"></div>` : ''}
          <span class="cco__slot-num">${i + 1}</span>
          ${filled ? `<span class="cco__slot-chord">${chordLabel(color!)}</span>` : '<span class="cco__slot-empty">empty</span>'}
        </button>
      `;
      }).join('');
    }

    function renderPalette() {
      const wrap = document.getElementById('cco-palette')!;
      // find which color is currently playing
      const playingColorIdx = playing && activeSlot >= 0 ? slots[activeSlot] : null;
      wrap.innerHTML = PALETTE.map((c, i) => `
        <button class="cco__swatch${i === playingColorIdx ? ' cco__swatch--active' : ''}" data-color="${i}" style="background:${c.hex}">
          <span class="cco__swatch-chord">${chordLabel(c)}</span>
          <span class="cco__swatch-name">${c.name}</span>
        </button>
      `).join('');
    }

    function nextEmptySlot(): number {
      for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) if (slots[i] == null) return i;
      return -1;
    }

    // ---- url state ----
    function setHashState() {
      const params = new URLSearchParams();
      params.set('s', slots.map(s => s == null ? '-' : String(s)).join(','));
      params.set('t', String(tempo));
      location.hash = params.toString();
    }
    function readHashState() {
      if (!location.hash) return;
      const params = new URLSearchParams(location.hash.slice(1));
      const s = params.get('s');
      const t = parseInt(params.get('t') || '');
      if (s) {
        const parts = s.split(',').slice(0, 4);
        while (parts.length < 4) parts.push('-');
        slots = parts.map(p => {
          if (p === '-') return null;
          const idx = parseInt(p);
          return Number.isNaN(idx) || idx < 0 || idx >= PALETTE.length ? null : idx;
        });
      }
      if (!Number.isNaN(t) && t >= 50 && t <= 120) tempo = t;
    }

    function init() {
      readHashState();
      // Default progression if empty
      if (slots.every(s => s == null)) {
        slots = [3, 4, 7, 1];  // cream → mint → blue → flame (G→Em7→Am→C)
      }
      (document.getElementById('cco-tempo') as HTMLInputElement).value = String(tempo);
      document.getElementById('cco-tempo-val')!.textContent = String(tempo);
      renderSlots();
      renderPalette();

      // Slot clicks: clear that slot
      document.getElementById('cco-progression')!.addEventListener('click', e => {
        const btn = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('[data-slot]');
        if (!btn) return;
        const i = parseInt(btn.getAttribute('data-slot')!);
        slots[i] = null;
        renderSlots();
      });

      // Palette clicks: fill next empty slot
      document.getElementById('cco-palette')!.addEventListener('click', e => {
        const btn = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('[data-color]');
        if (!btn) return;
        const colorIdx = parseInt(btn.getAttribute('data-color')!);
        let target = nextEmptySlot();
        if (target === -1) {
          // shift everything left and place at end
          slots = [slots[1], slots[2], slots[3], colorIdx];
        } else {
          slots[target] = colorIdx;
        }
        renderSlots();
      });

      document.getElementById('cco-play')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (playing) stopVamp();
        else startVamp();
      });
      document.getElementById('cco-clear')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
        slots = [null, null, null, null];
        renderSlots();
      });
      document.getElementById('cco-shuffle')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const indices = Array.from({ length: PALETTE.length }, (_, i) => i);
        for (let i = indices.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {
          const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));
          [indices[i], indices[j]] = [indices[j], indices[i]];
        }
        slots = [indices[0], indices[1], indices[2], indices[3]];
        renderSlots();
      });
      document.getElementById('cco-share')!.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        setHashState();
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(location.href);
          const s = document.getElementById('cco-share-status')!;
          s.textContent = 'copied to clipboard';
          setTimeout(() => { s.textContent = ''; }, 2200);
        } catch {
          const s = document.getElementById('cco-share-status')!;
          s.textContent = 'URL updated — copy from address bar';
          setTimeout(() => { s.textContent = ''; }, 3500);
        }
      });

      const tempoSlider = document.getElementById('cco-tempo') as HTMLInputElement;
      tempoSlider.addEventListener('input', () => {
        tempo = parseInt(tempoSlider.value);
        document.getElementById('cco-tempo-val')!.textContent = String(tempo);
      });

      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
        if (document.hidden && playing) stopVamp();
      });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
    } else {
      init();
    }
  </script>
</BlockLayout>
